力提升，且在后训练各检查点间迁移良好，但需为新基础模型重新训练，且只能检测可显式训练的已知违规类型。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","originalUrl":"https://alignment.openai.com/training-activation-classifiers","publishedAt":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-140i0f","originalSourceName":"OpenAI：Alignment 研究博客（RSS）","family":"openai","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/wlmiqh13694tqabyvu6nzvlrs","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-140i0f","name":"OpenAI：Alignment 研究博客（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-13T18:47:49.612Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"OpenAI 自 GPT-5.6 起在其最强模型的内部和外部流量上部署激活分类器（probes），利用模型内部激活逐 token 实时评分，可在生成中途阻断违规回复和工具调用并交由推理模型复审。实验显示 probes 比更大的文本分类器对测试的越狱攻击更鲁棒，准确率随模型能力提升，且在后训练各检查点间迁移良好，但需为新基础模型重新训练，且只能检测可显式训练的已知违规类型。","reportEdition":"2026-11-02","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/zv5dl1agqwo6tkmhdamy17lt5","title":"Ed Zitron 解析 OpenAI 1.25 万亿美元估值融资与 Anthropic S-1/A 中的万亿级算力承诺","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T17:16:20.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/zv5dl1agqwo6tkmhdamy17lt5","https://www.wheresyoured.at/running-dry"],"articles":[{"id":"zv5dl1agqwo6tkmhdamy17lt5","title":"Ed Zitron 解析 OpenAI 1.25 万亿美元估值融资与 Anthropic S-1/A 中的万亿级算力承诺","originalTitle":"","summary":"Ed Zitron 撰文认为 AI 行业资金正在枯竭。OpenAI 上周以 1.25 万亿美元估值融资 110 亿美元，低于此前计划的 300 亿美元、1.4 万